70
00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.811
i know you. You're. uh...

71
00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:58.050
- April O'Neil.
- April O'Neil. yeah.

72
00:07:58.091 --> 00:07:59.571
The news lady.

73
