Max-amundo.

92
00:09:25.413 --> 00:09:26.813
A cappella!

93
00:09:28.213 --> 00:09:31.654
Perestroika?

94
00:09:31.734 --> 00:09:35.213
Okay. i got it. "Frerejacques."
FrereJacques

