100
00:09:49.775 --> 00:09:52.493
Please. please.
A moment to reflect.

101
00:09:57.294 --> 00:09:58.895
Here comes the slice.

102
00:09:58.976 --> 00:10:01.174
- Enjoy.
- Ninja pizza!

103
00:10:01.254 --> 00:10:02.613
Ninja pizza?

104
00:10:02.694 --> 00:10:06.094
Pizza that vanish
