Tokka and Rahzar.
How cute.

1000
01:13:53.567 --> 01:13:57.246
Hey. We could make
a fortune in the diet racket.

1001
01:13:57.327 --> 01:13:58.966
Oh. Mikey.

1002
01:14:00.046 --> 01:14:03.126
- Maybe he set a distance record.
- Doubtful.

1003
01:14:03.167 --> 01:14:05.047
Hey. where'd he go?

1004
01:14:09.446 --> 01:14:12.366
- Anything?
- Nothing.

1005
01:14:12.447 --> 01:14:16.247
Well. dudes. i'd say
that's pretty much a wrap.

1006
01:14:16.327 --> 01:14:18.887
Cowabunga?

1007
01:14:18.966 --> 01:14:21.007
- Cowabunga!
- Yeah!

1008
01:14:21.088 --> 01:14:23.248
Cowabunga!

1009
01:14:40.608 --> 01:14:45.807
- The last vial of ooze!
- He must have drank all of it.

1010
01:14:45.887 --> 01:14:48.368
it's a super Shredder.

1011
01:14:59.288 --> 01:15:02.169
Great! Now what
are we supposed to do?

1012
01:15:05.888 --> 01:15:09.449
This thing can't take much more of this.
not with all that stuff on top.

1013
01:15:12.248 --> 01:15:14.808
Shredder. you got
to listen to reason!

1014
01:15:14.889 --> 01:15:16.888
You're gonna
destroy us all!

1015
01:15:18.929 --> 01:15:21.048
Then so be it!

1016
01:15:21.969 --> 01:15:23.450
You okay?

1017
01:15:25.249 --> 01:15:27.569
it's all coming down!

1018
01:15:27.649 --> 01:15:29.129
Watch your head. guys!

1019
01:15:30.890 --> 01:15:32.689
We're pancakes!

1020
01:15:36.450 --> 01:15:39.768
A true ninja is a master
of himself and his environment.

1021
01:15:39.849 --> 01:15:43.530
So don't forget.
We're turtles!

1022
01:16:26.331 --> 01:16:29.091
i've said it before.
and i'll say it again.

1023
01:16:29.132 --> 01:16:33.250
"Man. i love
being a turtle!"

1024
01:16:33.332 --> 01:16:35.931
- Too bad the Shredder can't say that.
- Yeah.

1025
01:16:36.611 --> 01:16:39.052
- Look!
- Wha...

1026
01:16:39.130 --> 01:16:41.531
it can't be.

1027
01:16:41.611 --> 01:16:44.491
Nobody could
have survived that.

1028
01:16:49.532 --> 01:16:51.612
That's the end
of the Shredder.

1029
01:16:51.692 --> 01:16:54.490
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

1030
01:16:54.530 --> 01:16:56.932
And in a bizarre
final note...

1031
01:16:57.011 --> 01:16:59.413
to the mysterious
disappearance of TGRI...

1032
01:16:59.492 --> 01:17:03.691
this message was delivered
to the station earlier today.

1033
01:17:03.771 --> 01:17:08.252
'"To Leonardo.
Michaelangelo. Raphael...

1034
01:17:08.292 --> 01:17:10.693
- And Donatello...
- Idiots.

1035
01:17:10.771 --> 01:17:14.332
thanks for
your help. dudes.

1036
01:17:14.412 --> 01:17:16.573
Signed.
ProfessorJordan Perry. "

1037
01:17:17.452 --> 01:17:20.172
Of course we can only
guess at its meaning.

1038
01:17:21.132 --> 01:17:22.573
And now this.

1039
01:17:26.133 --> 01:17:27.973
Bodacious!

1040
01:17:28.053 --> 01:17:31.333
- Ostentatious!
- Hey. hey. spacious!

1041
01:17:31.373 --> 01:17:34.093
Hey. dudes!
Cowabunga says it all!

1042
01:17:34.173 --> 01:17:36.853
Cowabunga!

1043
01:17:36.933 --> 01:17:38.772
Oh. yeah!

1044
01:17:39.813 --> 01:17:42.334
We're home.

1045
01:17:43.372 --> 01:17:45.374
Were you seen?

1046
01:17:45.414 --> 01:17:47.613
- Of course not. Master Splinter.
- We practice ninja.

1047
01:17:47.693 --> 01:17:49.693
The art of invisibility.

1048
01:17:53.894 --> 01:17:55.814
Practice harder.

1049
01:17:58.212 --> 01:18:01.013
Ten flips now!
And remember...

1050
01:18:01.094 --> 01:18:03.054
"Go. ninja
Go. ninja. go!"

1051
01:18:04.054 --> 01:18:14.054
i made another funny!

1052
